  "first.1": {
    "text": "The benchmark covers 8 roles and 22 scored tasks drawn from one creator's editing workflow. It does not measure general ability. Results reflect the access route, reasoning effort, tool setup, and model version used during testing in November 2026. Timing also depends on network conditions and provider load at the time. This project sets its own scoring rules and reviews some tasks by hand. See the notes next to flagged results."
  },
